1
00:00:00,591 --> 00:00:02,691
(applause and cheering)

2
00:00:02,693 --> 00:00:04,063
(whoops)

3
00:00:05,029 --> 00:00:07,599
(Howard:)And here's the wind-up...

4
00:00:07,598 --> 00:00:09,468
and the pitch!

5
00:00:10,435 --> 00:00:12,765
(whirring)

6
00:00:21,212 --> 00:00:23,742
Why is it going so slow?!

7
00:00:23,748 --> 00:00:26,578
'Cause I'm an idiot
who didn't think this through!

8
00:00:27,618 --> 00:00:29,048
(Sheldon:)Okay, new plan.

9
00:00:29,053 --> 00:00:30,623
(Sheldon:)We go to Disneyland,

10
00:00:30,621 --> 00:00:33,121
(Sheldon:)play hide and seek
on Tom Sawyer's Island,

11
00:00:33,124 --> 00:00:36,464
(Sheldon:)and then come back
and see the end of the pitch.

12
00:00:38,262 --> 00:00:40,332
(crowd booing)

13
00:00:45,903 --> 00:00:48,633
(Howard:)Okay, while we're waiting
for the ball to arrive,

14
00:00:48,639 --> 00:00:50,569
(Howard:)here's some fun facts
about Mars.

15
00:00:50,575 --> 00:00:53,875
KOOTHRAPPALI:
You suck, Wolowitz!

16
00:00:55,279 --> 00:00:57,809
He makes a valid point!

17
00:01:06,257 --> 00:01:12,727
(crowd booing)

18
00:01:14,565 --> 00:01:17,635
(Howard:)Okay, booing isn't gonna make it
go any faster!

